# Order Snapshots

Giu cac historical snapshot trong Order / OrderItem:

- price_at_purchase - BigDecimal.
- product_name - String.
- variant_name - String.
- recipient_name - String.
- recipient_phone - String.
- shipping_address - String (snapshot full dia chi).
- commission_rate - BigDecimal.
- platform_fee - BigDecimal.
- seller_amount - BigDecimal.

## Quy tac

- Snapshot la **historical record**, khong xem la loi 3NF chi vi du lieu co the ton tai o bang khac.
- Snapshot quan trong **khong nen thay doi** sau khi Order duoc tao.
- Cap nhat Order sau create chi nen doi status, tracking_code, cancel_reason - khong doi snapshot gia/dia chi.
- Neu user update address sau khi order da tao -> KHONG anh huong order hien tai (xem address-ownership.mdc).

## Ly do

- Audit: biet duoc gia/nguoi nhan/phi luc dat hang.
- Compliance: tranh tranh chap khi user doi thong tin sau.
- Finance: seller_amount/commission_rate la snapshot de tinh toan cho ky thanh toan.

## Khi sua order

- Service chi cap nhat cac field thuoc workflow: status, tracking_code, cancel_reason, cancel_at, completed_at.
- KHONG sua price_at_purchase, product_name, recipient_*, shipping_address sau khi create.
- Neu co loi trong snapshot luc tao -> cancel + tao order moi (KHONG sua snapshot).